'''Mr. Ninja!! Fever''' (ミスターニンジャ！！フィーバー, ''Misutāninja!! Fībā'') is an action game published by PONOS. This game has a collaboration event with [[Nyanko Daisensou]] (a.k.a '''Mr. Ninja!! Fever Challenge Campaign''' in [[The Battle Cats]]) The event starts from August 19th, 2015 (11:00am) to September 19th, 2015 (10:59am).

==Event==
:"Another exciting and easy-to-play action game from PONOS! Jump and slash your way through the universe with the newest update to '''Mr. Ninja!! Fever'''.
:'''The Battle Cats''' is celebrating the newest update of Mr. Ninja!! Fever with cool prizes!
:Mr. Ninja has been reborn with new and exciting game modes to play - try it out and unlock rewards for The Battle Cats!"
#Clear the tutorial of BATTLE MODE and get 100 [[Cat Food]].
#Clear the first gate in ADVENTURE MODE to unlock a [[Mr. Ninja (Special Cat)|Mr. Ninja Unit]]!!


[Reward #1]

Clear tutorial of Mr. Ninja!! Fever's Battle Mode to get 100 Cat Food!
*Reward Conditions
Install the newest version of Mr. Ninja!! Fever and complete the tutorial of Battle Mode.
*Receiving Your Prize
#Install the newest version of Mr. Ninja Fever and complete the tutorial of Battle Mode.
#Select "Event Stage" from the Mode Select screen.
#Locate the event icon from the Event Stage menu.
#Tap the icon to display the event link page.
#Tap the first button to open The Battle Cats application and recieve your 100 Cat Food.


[Reward #2]

Open the first Gate on Adventure Mode to unlock a special Mr. Ninja unit in The Battle Cats!
*Reward Conditions
Challenge Mr. Ninja!! Fever's new Adventure Mode! Unlock the first Gate to add Mr. Ninja to your army in The Battle Cats!
*Receiving Your Prize
1. Install the newest version of Mr. Ninja!! Fever and play through the first 25 stages of Adventure mode to reach the first gate.

:Follow the instructions below to open the gate!

:[How to Open the Gate]

:The first Gate will appear once you have cleared the first 25 Stages of Adventure Mode.

:There are several ways that can be used to open the gate.
*Wait for the 24-hour timer to count down.
*Receive a key from one of your Facebook friends.
*Spend 100 Rubies to unlock the Gate immediately.
2. Select "Event Stage" from the Mode Select screen.

3. Locate the event icon from the Event Stage menu.

4. Tap on the icon to display the event link page.

5. Tap the second button to open The Battle Cats application and receive Mr. Ninja from the Special Characterss section of your Upgrade screen.

